# <%= projectName %>

Shared static files (images, icons, fonts, JSON). Put them under `assets/`.

## Use it in an app

Add this entry to the app's `project.json` → `targets.build.options.assets`:

```json
{ "glob": "**/*", "input": "<%= projectRoot %>/assets", "output": "assets/<%= dir %>" }
```

The files are then served from `assets/<%= dir %>/…`, e.g. `<img src="assets/<%= dir %>/logo.svg" />`.
